{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The exploration returned success after the nonvoter’s successful-response count increased; both remote voter counts stayed unchanged. It also recorded a real election and applied command. That supports the counting concern, but does not establish lost authority. The next check will test whether verification can succeed after another voter has won a higher-term election and committed a command, before the old leader’s verification call begins.\n"}}
